# IMPORTANT: do not rewrite "/" (or any path the SPA itself resolves to "/")
# to app-home.html here. Cloudflare Pages unconditionally 308-redirects any
# literal *.html request to its extensionless form (e.g. /index.html -> /) —
# that's a fixed platform behavior, not something _redirects controls. The
# PWA service worker fetches /index.html directly to populate its precache,
# so a "/" -> app-home.html rewrite here means the SW's own precache request
# for index.html gets redirected into serving the marketing page instead of
# the real SPA shell, which then gets served for every future navigation.
# The marketing page is still reachable directly at /app-home(.html); it
# must not be aliased onto "/" itself. BrowserRouter routes are handled by
# the SPA fallback below; real assets and Pages Functions take precedence.
/* /index.html 200
